{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "A Day With Vanessa", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "I Wish I Had", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Second Conditional - Talking About Hypothetical Situations", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the second conditional to talk about unreal or imaginary (hypothetical) situations in the present or future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">If I had a million dollars, I would buy a car.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do you have a million dollars?  No.<br/>Is it possible to suddenly get a million dollars? Not really.<br/>What would you do if you had a million dollars? Buy a car.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use: <span class=\"italic\"> If + Simple Past verb ...  + would/could</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">If</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Condition</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Result</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">would + base verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I married Peter,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I would be happy.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I exercised more,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I could be in better shape.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I were you,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I would be jumping up and down.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You can also reverse the clauses:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I would be out more if I were you.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Notice that there is no comma when the result clause comes first.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Remember to use a comma (,) after the If clause. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In conversation, it is common to use contractions. (I would = I'd)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If I were you, I would carry a spare pair of shoes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If you exercised more, you wouldn't feel so broken right now.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If I were you, I'd be out there more! ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About Wishes and Imaginary Situations", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">wish</span> and the second conditional to talk about things you want or would like to be different now or in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Wishes and sentences in the second conditional infer that what you want is probably not possible, or for some reason impossible.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Statement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish it were all that easy!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's not that easy.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I could just go back for a few days and enjoy it all again.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I can't go back.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I were young again!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am not young anymore.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I wish I wore more comfortable shoes, though. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I wish I talked to more people there. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I wish I weren't so shy ...", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "foldable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "able to fold ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You know those foldable shoes they sell now? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about social activities.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "flats", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a pair of flat shoes (similar to ballet shoes) worn by women", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you know those foldable flats they sell now? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to spin", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to play a record", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The DJ spun my favorite songs.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "coming right up!", "type": "name"}, {"content": "You will have it soon.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your coffee is coming right up!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to get back in the game", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to start dating again ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need to get back in the game.", "type": "example"}, {"co